    "🔔 Boss", "🔔 World Boss", "🔔 Climax", "🔔 Coffres & Trésors", "🔔 Quiz & Énigmes",
    "🔔 Chasses", "🔔 Invasions", "🔔 Conseil", "🔔 Events Collaboratifs",
